      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1>Close the Line</h1><p><em>The captain points to the gap before anyone else sees it.</em></p><h2>Rules</h2><p><strong>ID:</strong> monster-veteran-captain-close-the-line</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Maneuver</p><p>One willing ally within 3 squares that can hear may move 1 square immediately, ending adjacent to another ally. This voluntary movement provokes normally; once per turn.</p><p><strong>Limits:</strong> Costs its Maneuver; no extra action is granted.</p>"
      },
